 "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215948109", "author": {"steamid": "76561198120746901", "personaname": "Uncle Bubby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/timessiahbassmachine/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 4666, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2318, "last_played": 1769412418, "avatar": "707e56f6f5a748291e6c1e86c4f5a32d5f0ccee9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lets me shoot....people. 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1768385437, "timestamp_updated": 1768385437, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215934628", "author": {"steamid": "76561199012097236", "personaname": "Citrus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CitrusDreams/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 938, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 913, "last_played": 1768506989, "avatar": "3f5e9daea59216d7fe13df4e031d3537580e5e21"}, "language": "english", "review": "Story is okay, really short and the only draw is the Axis Invasions. Didn't see a reason to play through the story more than once honestly, picking up collectibles is fine but the stealth is incredibly simple and combing large maps for hidden things isn't my idea of a good time. On the topic of Axis invasions, not once did a German Sniper actually manage to kill me as, from my perspective, they have zero advantages. The NPC's are laughably non-threatening and if you DO die to them it can only be because you've been blundering around like drunkard. Playing as an invader can be very fun, if you're lucky enough to get a player who is leaning into the spirit of the \"sniper vs sniper\" aspect and not someone who decided to sit in a corner with a single entrance, booby trapped bodies on every square inch of the map and no real way to find them other than the laughable \"anti-camping\" system. Either I spawn in and end up exploding because I forgot to check the 3rd body piled onto my spawn or I have an enjoyable encounter with a decently skilled sniper, honestly there should be a system to allow you to at least filter out players you come against that are playing in a way that's just unfun, at least then they'd eventually be on every avoid list and eventually be filtered out of the game.", "timestamp_created": 1768359495, "timestamp_updated": 1768359495, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}